***conformance tests***

# meta-today-and-defaults
`GET /api/meta` answers 200 with `today` "2026-11-21", `syntheticData` true, `defaultPatientId` "p3", `modelVersion` "tracer-gbm-0.1", one clinician with id "c1", and `outcomes` with the six :Outcome: ids.

# two-pathways
`GET /api/pathways` answers 200 with the codes "stroke" and "ctr", each with two games in order: "trace" with levels [1, 2, 3] and optionalLevels [], then "camera" with levels [1, 2, 3] and optionalLevels [2, 3]; and the questions "wellbeing" and "pain".
